Z||000017||LZeitgeist||05-25-2001||04:52 PM||||Fiero5 - <BR>I hope my post didn't sound like I was saying I thought it looked rice-y... I kinda like it.<P>I love to do things to cars that look like they may have come that way as a factory option... "OEM believability", I call it. I think yours is pretty close to that... if this group didn't know for sure that there never was such a thing as a Fiero SS, I'd believe it...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>(BTW - SS usually stands for Super Sport, but you can call it whatever you like.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">)||||reg||1
